Commands:
  show                  print settings
  mon                   toggle live readout
  rpm <n>               simulate input (e.g. rpm 3000)
  live                  back to real input
  sweep [n]             sweep 0 -> full -> 0 (n times; step-loss test)
  home                  re-zero against the stop
  goto <deg>            hold needle at angle
  jog <deg>             nudge needle (+/-)
  setzero               needle is on the 0 mark now -> store offset from stop
  motor off | motor on  de-energize / re-energize coils
  set <key> <value>     keys: sweep max ppr maxrpm filter speed accel deadband
